<!-- Merge these keys into ios/App/App/Info.plist after `npx cap add ios`. -->
<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
<string>Estrellita uses Face ID to unlock your home after each launch. Your chores stay hidden until you confirm it’s you.</string>
<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
<string>Estrellita uses your location once during setup to pick weather and seasonal tasks. We store only a ZIP and coordinates rounded to two decimals.</string>
<key>NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</key>
<string></string>
<key>NSUserNotificationsUsageDescription</key>
<string>Estrellita can send a weekly restock digest when something needs to be ordered. The app never places orders or stores payment information.</string>
